# /r/* — unlisted AUTH-LOCKED doc shims (2026-08-15; first tenant: the
# shelf-server runbook, devops-gated). The pages themselves are GITIGNORED
# (public/r/ — this repo is public, a committed page would put its "hidden"
# URL in the open history) and ship only because Pages uploads the working
# tree. This rule is a SPLAT on purpose, twice over: it must not name any
# slug, and a splat also sidesteps the trailing-slash 308 trap documented
# atop this file (it matches /r/<slug>, /r/<slug>/ and /r/<slug>/doc.js).
# Each page is a CONTENT-FREE shim in /todo's exact shape — the content
# lives in the auth Worker's estate_docs KV behind requireDevops() — so the
# CSP is /todo's sign-in allow-list, with style-src widened to cover the
# KV fragment's injected <style> and img-src kept to self+data:.
# X-Robots-Tag backs up each page's own noindex meta at the header layer.
/r/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com; connect-src https://auth.heygabi.ai https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; frame-src https://audiobook-catalog.firebaseapp.com https://accounts.google.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

